### Health check
GET http://localhost:4000/health

### Register student
POST http://localhost:4000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Manual Test Student",
  "email": "manual-test-student-{{$timestamp}}@example.com",
  "password": "Password123",
  "role": "student"
}

### Register mentor
POST http://localhost:4000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Manual Test Mentor",
  "email": "manual-test-mentor-{{$timestamp}}@example.com",
  "password": "Password123",
  "role": "mentor"
}

### Reject admin registration
POST http://localhost:4000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Fake Admin",
  "email": "fake-admin-{{$timestamp}}@example.com",
  "password": "Password123",
  "role": "admin"
}

### Reject duplicate email
POST http://localhost:4000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Duplicate Test Student",
  "email": "duplicate-test-student@example.com",
  "password": "Password123",
  "role": "student"
}
